<title>USA: PXRE to begin trading on NYSE December 31.</title>
<headline>PXRE to begin trading on NYSE December 31.</headline>
<dateline>EDISON, N.J. 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>PXRE Corp said Monday that it has been approved for listing on the New York Stock Exchange. The company said its shares will begin trading December 31 under the symbol &quot;PXT.&quot;</p>
<p>PXRE now trades on the Nasdaq National Market. It said it currently has about 14.5 million common shares outstanding.</p>
